{
    "title": "Guitar Hero Mobile: Music Game",
    "description": "Hey there! Do you dig music and rhythm games? Wanna show off your chops on the guitar or piano? Then My Music Hero is the perfect game for you! \ud83c\udfb9\r\n\r\nThis music game is like Guitar Hero, where you can play the electric guitar or piano to the beat of the most famous songs from all over the world! \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on the split-screen mode for 2 players! \ud83d\udc65\r\n\r\nRock, pop, reggaeton, country, EDM, and the best classics - there's a music genre for every taste. \ud83d\udd79\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Win stars and diamonds to unlock dozens of songs! \ud83d\udc8e\r\n\r\nThere are three different difficulties to choose from. \ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\nGlobal leaderboard! \ud83c\udfc6\r\nBecome the number one song after song and get the best score on all rankings and difficulties. \ud83d\ude80\r\n\r\nMultiplayer duels! \ud83c\udf8c\ud83c\udd9a\ud83c\udf8c\r\nSend challenges to your friends, participate in daily tournaments, and win duels against random people in random mode.\r\n\r\nAn innovative and intuitive game, download now and become the music hero! \ud83d\udc51\r\n\r\nAll songs were used with prior authorization.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hey there! Do you dig music and rhythm games? Wanna show off your chops on the guitar or piano? Then My Music Hero is the perfect game for you! \ud83c\udfb9<br><br>This music game is like Guitar Hero, where you can play the electric guitar or piano to the beat of the most famous songs from all over the world! \ud83c\udf89<br><br>Don&#39;t miss out on the split-screen mode for 2 players! \ud83d\udc65<br><br>Rock, pop, reggaeton, country, EDM, and the best classics - there&#39;s a music genre for every taste. \ud83d\udd79<br><br>\u2b50 Win stars and diamonds to unlock dozens of songs! \ud83d\udc8e<br><br>There are three different difficulties to choose from. \ud83d\udd25<br><br>Global leaderboard! \ud83c\udfc6<br>Become the number one song after song and get the best score on all rankings and difficulties. \ud83d\ude80<br><br>Multiplayer duels! \ud83c\udf8c\ud83c\udd9a\ud83c\udf8c<br>Send challenges to your friends, participate in daily tournaments, and win duels against random people in random mode.<br><br>An innovative and intuitive game, download now and become the music hero! \ud83d\udc51<br><br>All songs were used with prior authorization.",
